  "goodToKnow": "Absetzen has many meanings: to take off (den Hut absetzen), to drop someone off (Ich setze dich am Bahnhof ab), to remove from office (den König absetzen), to cancel (eine Sendung absetzen), to stop a medicine, and to deduct from tax (steuerlich absetzen, every German's favourite). Sich absetzen means to get away or to stand out from others. Der Absatz (paragraph, heel, sales) shares the root."
